      "content": "yo just finished a brutal 3hr hiit session in this humidity and im feeling super weak and my muscles are cramping like crazy. i have some potassium chloride supplements in my cabinet... should i just take two large doses (like 2000mg) right now to replenish what i lost in sweat? i need to feel better fast.",
