    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but a banana is so small compared to what i just lost... i feel like i'm completely drained. wouldn't the supplement be more effective for getting my levels back up quickly? i'm worried if i don't do more than just a sports drink i'm gonna pass out or something. is 2000mg really that bad for someone who just did 3 hours of cardio?",
